  "title": "Tool definition module types",
  "goal": "Port the `tools/definition` classes: the module types a tool definition is made of (`tconstruct:base_stats`, `tconstruct:part_stats`, `tconstruct:multiply_stats`, `tconstruct:modifier_slots`, `tconstruct:traits`, `tconstruct:is_effective`, `tconstruct:tool_actions` are carried; the other 32 are raw data). Each module is a struct with a loader registered in the tool module registry (src/tools/definition.rs) so that all 45 of the original's definition files load with the module as code and not raw data. The test in tests/original_data.rs must show how many modules are code after your change.",
